silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#sourcepacket a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#sourcepacket" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#sourcepacket silm:hasLongDescription "The SourcePacket is the Mittens body-mass observation record from the May 2026 vet visit at Tartu Animal Clinic, entering the engine as a typed quality-claim source packet. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{SourcePacket}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#typedclaim a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#typedclaim" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#typedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedClaim is the Mittens vaccination record FVRCP-2026-03-15, entering as a typed evidence packet with provenance and validation envelope. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TypedClaim}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#manifest a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#manifest" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#manifest silm:hasLongDescription "The Manifest is the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{Manifest} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#shapegate a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#shapegate" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#shapegate silm:hasLongDescription "The ShapeGate is the Mittens coat-pattern observation (torbie, three-color) entering as a typed quality-claim into the manifest profile reader. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ShapeGate}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#_ a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#_" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#_ silm:hasLongDescription "The \\ is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#tasknode a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#tasknode" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#tasknode silm:hasLongDescription "The TaskNode is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg, recoverable as a typed leg into D_Mittens but not interchangeable with the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TaskNode}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#tracewitness a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#tracewitness" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#tracewitness silm:hasLongDescription "The TraceWitness is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TraceWitness}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#typednode a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#typednode" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#typednode silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedNode is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TypedNode} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#ologleg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#ologleg" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#ologleg silm:hasLongDescription "The OlogLeg is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{OlogLeg}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#publishedclaim a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#publishedclaim" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#publishedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The PublishedClaim is the ChunkManifest profiling the music-entry task — a Yoneda-profile reader for incoming and outgoing arrows of the engine apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{PublishedClaim} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#colimitapex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#colimitapex" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#colimitapex silm:hasLongDescription "The ColimitApex is the SourceWitness from the cannon/cat/joy_of_cats.md JoC §11 colimit citation, an external authority source leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ColimitApex}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#cat a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#cat" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#cat silm:hasLongDescription "The Cat is the EvidencePacket carrying the typing decision and path law that admits the Mittens vaccination record, distinct from the raw audio file or storage object. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{Cat} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittens a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#mittens" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Mittens is the AvroPacket serializing a Mittens body-mass observation as a typed record schema, licensed by the AvroSchema for transport. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#musicengine a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#musicengine" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#musicengine silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicEngine is the AvroRecord as a schema-layer transport node (silver schemanode), distinct from the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{MusicEngine}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#publishedsection a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#publishedsection" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#publishedsection silm:hasLongDescription "The PublishedSection is the KGEdge (Mittens, hasQuality, BodyMass) admitted to the engine via the typed olog arrow hasQuality. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{PublishedSection}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#encyclopediafreemonad a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#encyclopediafreemonad" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#encyclopediafreemonad silm:hasLongDescription "The EncyclopediaFreeMonad is the KGNode for Mittens-the-cat as a knowledge-graph reference distinct from the categorical apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{EncyclopediaFreeMonad} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#musicentry a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#musicentry" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#musicentry silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicEntry is the OlogLeg arrow that the Mittens body-mass observation flows through on its way to the published quality section. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{MusicEntry}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#sourcesignature a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#sourcesignature" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#sourcesignature silm:hasLongDescription "The SourceSignature is the PublishedClaim (the rendered quality-section of the Music encyclopedia entry) as the outgoing-profile materialization, distinct from the engine that produced it. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{SourceSignature}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#publishedargument a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor#publishedargument" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor#publishedargument silm:hasLongDescription "The PublishedArgument is the IncomingProfile Hom(-, MusicEngine) at X=Mittens, the set of typed source legs that point at the engine apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{PublishedArgument}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
